<overview>
<p>The Draconis Combine Mustered Soldiery assigns conventional infantry to garrison roles across its military districts, with district regulars often fielding extra platoons to secure worlds that BattleMech forces cannot permanently garrison. The platoon operates an Arrow IV guided missile system capable of precision indirect fire at extreme range. When a TAG spotter designates a target, the Arrow IV's homing munitions can place ordnance on a specific vehicle or position with accuracy that conventional tube artillery cannot match.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on re-introduction date of Arrow IV
</notes>

